item.ptxt:
(If ECM detects a malfunction only in the first driving cycle (refer to 
Driving Cycle
) but does not detect the same malfunction in the next 2 consecutive driving cycles, ECM does not turn on MIL although it retains the associated DTC in its memory.)

For some malfunctions, ECM adopts the 3 driving cycle detection logic (refer to 
3 Driving Cycle Detection Logic
) to prevent erroneous detection.
